  "storyNotes": [
   "6,495,570 taxi trips started in 2023 (5,786,096 / 89% have both pickup and dropoff community areas; the rest are suppressed by the city for privacy or outside Chicago).",
   "Busiest pickup area: Near North Side (1,406,177 trips); the Near North Side/Loop/O'Hare trio dominates the OD matrix. Top flows: Near North Side -> Near North Side: 464,844 trips; Loop -> Near North Side: 291,722 trips; Ohare -> Near North Side: 274,747 trips",
   "Hourly rhythm: weekday peak at 17:00, weekend peak at 17:00; quietest hour is 03:00.",
   "Busiest day 2023-06-02 (25,423 trips, Friday); quietest 2023-12-25 (4,993, Monday).",
   "20% of mapped trips stay inside one community area. Highest mean fare among flows with >2,000 trips: Garfield Ridge -> Ohare ($74, 2,692 trips)."
